        "result": "2025-Q1 nonfarm unit labor costs increased 5.7%, with hourly compensation +4.8% and productivity -0.8%. 2025-Q2 unit labor costs increased 1.6%, with compensation +4.0% and productivity +2.4%. These are seasonally adjusted annualized quarterly preliminary prints."
