        "result": "2025-Q3 nonfarm unit labor costs decreased 1.9%, with hourly compensation +2.9% and productivity +4.9%. 2025-Q4 unit labor costs increased 2.8%, with compensation +5.7% and productivity +2.8%. Both values are the respective preliminary prints."
